{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-expressions","title":"六年级数学 — 代数表达式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-6/mathematics/algebra-transition/algebraic-expressions","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"六年级数学-代数表达式\">六年级数学 — 代数表达式</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>代数表达式是用字母和数字组合起来表示数量关系的式子。它是从算术到代数的桥梁——用字母代替未知数，让我们能够表示更加一般化的数学规律。</p>\n<p>从算术到代数的过渡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算术表达</th>\n<th>代数表达</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3 + 5 = 8</td>\n<td>a + b = c</td>\n<td>两数之和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长×宽 = 面积</td>\n<td>S = a × b</td>\n<td>长方形面积公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某数的3倍加2等于17</td>\n<td>3x + 2 = 17</td>\n<td>用x表示未知数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常用的字母表示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字母</th>\n<th>常用含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>x, y</td>\n<td>未知数</td>\n<td>求x的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a, b, c</td>\n<td>已知量或常数</td>\n<td>三角形三条边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n</td>\n<td>自然数或项数</td>\n<td>第n个数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S</td>\n<td>面积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = a^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"用字母表示数\">用字母表示数</h3><p>字母可以代表任何数，这让我们能够表示普遍的规律。</p>\n<p><strong>用字母表示运算定律</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算定律</th>\n<th>文字描述</th>\n<th>字母表示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加法交换律</td>\n<td>两个加数交换位置，和不变</td>\n<td>a + b = b + a</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加法结合律</td>\n<td>先加前两个或后两个，结果不变</td>\n<td>(a+b)+c = a+(b+c)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法交换律</td>\n<td>两个因数交换位置，积不变</td>\n<td>a × b = b × a</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法结合律</td>\n<td>先乘前两个或后两个，结果不变</td>\n<td>(a×b)×c = a×(b×c)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法分配律</td>\n<td>两个数的和乘以一个数</td>\n<td>(a+b)×c = a×c + b×c</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>用字母表示公式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图形</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>字母含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长方形面积</td>\n<td>S = a × b</td>\n<td>a=长，b=宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角形面积</td>\n<td>S = a × h ÷ 2</td>\n<td>a=底，h=高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圆的面积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\pi r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>r=半径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圆的周长</td>\n<td>C = 2πr</td>\n<td>r=半径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长方体体积</td>\n<td>V = a × b × c</td>\n<td>a=长，b=宽，c=高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"代数表达式的书写规则\">代数表达式的书写规则</h3><p><strong>省略乘号</strong>：字母与字母、数字与字母相乘时，可以省略乘号&quot;×&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原式</th>\n<th>简写</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>a × b</td>\n<td>ab</td>\n<td>字母之间省略×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 × x</td>\n<td>3x</td>\n<td>数字写在字母前面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a × a</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>读作&quot;a的平方&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 × a</td>\n<td>a</td>\n<td>系数为1可以省略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a ÷ b</td>\n<td>a/b</td>\n<td>除法写成分数形式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数字总写在字母前面：写3a，不写a3</li>\n<li>系数为1时省略1：写a，不写1a</li>\n<li>字母按字母表顺序排列：写abc，不写cba</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代数表达式的值\">代数表达式的值</h3><p>当字母取特定的值时，代数表达式就会得到一个具体的结果。</p>\n<p>例：当 a = 3, b = 5 时，求下列表达式的值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>代入计算</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>a + b</td>\n<td>3 + 5</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2a + b</td>\n<td>2×3 + 5</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ab</td>\n<td>3 × 5</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2 + b^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>9 + 25</td>\n<td>34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3a - 2b</td>\n<td>9 - 10</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用代数表达式表示规律\">用代数表达式表示规律</h3><p><strong>数列规律</strong>：</p>\n<p>观察数列 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, ...</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第1个数：2 = 2×1</li>\n<li>第2个数：4 = 2×2</li>\n<li>第3个数：6 = 2×3</li>\n<li>第n个数：2n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以这个数列的第n个数可以用 2n 来表示。当 n=100 时，第100个数是 2×100=200。</p>\n<p><strong>几何规律</strong>：</p>\n<p>用火柴棒搭正方形：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正方形个数</th>\n<th>火柴棒数</th>\n<th>规律</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4 = 3×1+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>7 = 3×2+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>10 = 3×3+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n</td>\n<td>3n+1</td>\n<td>每增加一个正方形多3根</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当 n = 20 时，需要 3×20+1 = 61 根火柴棒。</p>\n<h3 id=\"简单的合并同类项\">简单的合并同类项</h3><p>含有相同字母部分的项可以合并。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>3a + 5a = 8a（3个a加5个a等于8个a）</li>\n<li>7x - 2x = 5x</li>\n<li>4ab + 3ab = 7ab</li>\n<li>2a + 3b 不能合并（字母不同）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><h3 id=\"练习一-翻译表达式\">练习一：翻译表达式</h3><p>把下列文字用代数表达式表示：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>一个数x的5倍</li>\n<li>a与b的和的3倍</li>\n<li>比x大7的数</li>\n<li>y的平方减去3</li>\n<li>两个连续整数的和（设较小的数为n）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"练习二-求值\">练习二：求值</h3><p>当 x = 4, y = 2 时，求下列表达式的值：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>3x + 2y</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2 - y^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>2xy + 5</li>\n<li>x/y + y</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"练习三-找规律\">练习三：找规律</h3><ol>\n<li>观察数列 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, ...，写出第n个数的表达式。</li>\n<li>用三角形拼图案：1个三角形用3根火柴，2个并排三角形用5根，3个用7根，n个用几根？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>代数学的名称来自阿拉伯数学家花拉子密（约780-850年）的著作《代数学》（Al-jabr）。&quot;algebra&quot;这个英文词就来源于阿拉伯语&quot;al-jabr&quot;。</p>\n<p>用字母表示数的方法是法国数学家韦达（1540-1603年）首先系统使用的。他的创新大大推动了数学的发展，使得人们能够表达和研究普遍性的数学规律，而不仅仅是处理具体的数字。</p>\n<p>代数是初中数学的核心内容。方程、不等式、函数等都建立在代数表达式的基础上。现在学好用字母表示数和简单的代数运算，就为初中数学的学习铺平了道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代数表达式用字母和数字表示数量关系，是从算术到代数的过渡</li>\n<li>书写规则：省略乘号、数字在字母前、系数1可省略、除法写成分数</li>\n<li>代入具体的值可以求出表达式的结果</li>\n<li>代数表达式可以表示数列规律和几何规律，揭示普遍性的数学关系</li>\n<li>同类项（相同字母部分）可以合并，是代数运算的基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同主题基础（本 hub 兄弟篇）：<a href=\"negative-numbers\">负数认识</a>——字母可以代表任意数（含负数），先理解负数能让代数表达式的取值更完整。</li>\n<li>同主题应用（本 hub 兄弟篇）：<a href=\"equation-applications\">方程应用</a>——会写代数表达式，才能进一步建立含未知数的等式即方程。</li>\n<li>衔接初中（grade-7 数学）：<a href=\"../../../../middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/algebraic-expressions\">代数式</a>——初中系统学习单项式、多项式与合并同类项，是本篇&quot;用字母表示数&quot;的深化。</li>\n<li>同主题基础（grade-5 数学）：<a href=\"../../../grade-5/mathematics/advanced-operations/equation-basics\">方程基础</a>——用字母表示数是列方程的前提，可回看方程的最初形态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"六年级数学 — 代数表达式","id":"六年级数学-代数表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"用字母表示数","id":"用字母表示数"},{"level":3,"text":"代数表达式的书写规则","id":"代数表达式的书写规则"},{"level":3,"text":"代数表达式的值","id":"代数表达式的值"},{"level":3,"text":"用代数表达式表示规律","id":"用代数表达式表示规律"},{"level":3,"text":"简单的合并同类项","id":"简单的合并同类项"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":3,"text":"练习一：翻译表达式","id":"练习一-翻译表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"练习二：求值","id":"练习二-求值"},{"level":3,"text":"练习三：找规律","id":"练习三-找规律"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"六年级数学 — 负数认识","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-6/mathematics/algebra-transition/negative-numbers"},"next":{"title":"六年级数学 — 方程应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-6/mathematics/algebra-transition/equation-applications"}}